  **Lessons:** terminal state must be explicit wherever direct, batch, and provider-owned turns diverge; extension manifests improve reviewability only when registration validates them and permissions remain clearly non-sandbox metadata; parallel test worker startup can cause false timeouts in the heavy module graph, so preserve per-file isolation while executing files serially.

